<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 3,000 T soybean meal for Georgia.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 3,000 T soybean meal for Georgia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it is seeking up to 3,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean meal in bulk under the export donation program to Georgia.</p>
<p>Shipment is slated for October 10-November 5.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said offers are due by September 25.</p>
<p>-Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
